    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προελ-αύνω</span></b> , intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ride on</i> or <i>forward,</i>
